---
layout: layouts/base.njk
bodyClass: "ind-page"
pagination:
  data: webinarSchedule.all
  size: 1
  alias: session
  # Without this Eleventy puts only the FIRST paginated page into collections.all,
  # so sitemap.njk — which iterates that collection — listed one session and
  # silently dropped the other five.
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/webinars/{{ session.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  # `| safe` because these are rendered here and escaped again by base.njk on
  # output. Without it an apostrophe becomes &amp;#39; in the browser tab.
  title: "{{ session.title | safe }} | Free Webinar | Ad On Group"
  description: "{{ session.blurb | safe }} Free live webinar, {{ session.pretty }}, {{ session.prettyTime }}. Run by Claude Certified Associates at Ad On Group."
---
{#
  One page per public webinar, generated from _data/webinars.json.

  These pages are the mechanism the workshop competitors get for free: a
  three-month program is a private engagement that produces nothing anyone can
  link to, while a public event produces a dated, listable, markup-able artefact
  every month.

  The recording is never published here — it goes to the members' academy, which
  makes attending live the reason to show up and the academy a reason to join.
  Said as an offer, not as an apology.
#}
<main class="ind">

  <section>
    <p class="ind-eyebrow">Free live webinar</p>
    <h1>{{ session.title }}</h1>
    <p class="ind-lede">{{ session.blurb }}</p>

    <div class="wb-when">
      <div><span class="wb-label">When</span><b>{{ session.pretty }}</b><span>{{ session.prettyTime }}</span></div>
      <div><span class="wb-label">Where</span><b>Online</b><span>Link sent on registration</span></div>
      <div><span class="wb-label">Cost</span><b>Free</b><span>45 minutes</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="ind-actions">
      <a class="ind-cta" href="/ai-enquiry/">Register for this session</a>
      <a class="ind-cta-alt" href="/webinars/">All upcoming webinars</a>
    </div>
    <p class="ind-trust">
      <b>Trusted by over {{ proof.clientCount }} Australian businesses.</b>
      Australian-owned since {{ proof.since }}, rated {{ proof.rating }} from
      {{ proof.reviewCount }} Google reviews, and run by Claude Certified Associates.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-logos" aria-label="Businesses that work with Ad On Group">
      {% for c in proof.clients %}
      <img src="{{ c.src }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" loading="lazy" width="120" height="40">
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if session.covers and session.covers.length %}
  <section>
    <h2>What we'll cover</h2>
    <ul class="ind-list">
      {% for c in session.covers %}<li>{{ c }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section>
    <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    <p>
      Non-technical people who do this work daily — owners, managers and the staff actually
      producing the documents. No coding, no jargon, and not a product demo. Forty-five
      minutes, worked examples on real tasks, and questions at the end.
    </p>
    <p>
      Come with a task you'd like to hand over and you'll leave with a way to do it. That's
      the whole point of running these in public rather than behind a paywall.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who's running it</h2>
    <p>
      Claude Certified Associates at Ad On Group, who deliver the same material in our
      three-month program. Not a guest speaker, and not a salesperson with slides.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-people">
      {% for t in proof.trainers %}
      <a class="ind-person" href="{{ t.url }}">
        <img src="{{ t.img }}" alt="{{ t.name }}, {{ t.role }}" loading="lazy" width="120" height="120">
        <span><b>{{ t.name }}</b>{{ t.role }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="ind-note">
      <h2>About the recording</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Recordings go to our academy members rather than the public.</strong> It's
        what our members pay for, so we keep it that way — which makes the live session the
        one to come to. Academy access, and the recording of every session, is included with
        every <a href="/programs/">training program</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if session.industry %}
  <section>
    <h2>Going further than one session</h2>
    <p>
      Forty-five minutes gets your team started. The three-month program is what turns it
      into how they work — {{ curriculum.moduleCount }} modules, two private sessions a
      month with a Claude Certified Associate, weekly masterclasses, and a community that
      keeps it current. The
      {% for i in industries.items %}{% if i.url == session.industry %}<a href="{{ i.url }}">{{ i.label | lower }} program</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      is the version built around this sector's actual work.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-actions">
      {% for i in industries.items %}{% if i.url == session.industry %}
      <a class="ind-cta-alt" href="{{ i.url }}">See the {{ i.label | lower }} program</a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      <a class="ind-cta-alt" href="{{ curriculum.pdf }}" download>Download the curriculum</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section>
    <h2>The rest of the series</h2>
    <p>{{ webinarSchedule.cadence }}. Free, online, and open to anyone.</p>
    <div class="ind-more">
      {% for s in webinarSchedule.all %}{% if s.slug != session.slug %}
      <a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.title }}</a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Save your spot</h2>
    <p>
      Free, online, 45 minutes. Register and we'll send the link, plus a reminder the
      morning of the session.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-actions">
      <a class="ind-cta" href="/ai-enquiry/">Register for this session</a>
      <a class="ind-cta-alt" href="/ai-quiz/">Take the free AI audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
